args: opentide --json share preview --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Show what push would do. Makes no request and writes nothing.

Usage: opentide share preview [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --target <TARGET>
          Destination block name. Repeatable.

      --uuid <UUID>
          Limit to these object UUIDs.

      --type <OBJECT_TYPE>
          Limit to threat, objective, or rule.

      --file <FILE>
          Limit to these object files.

      --workers <WORKERS>
          Parallel object workers for one destination.
          
          [default: 1]

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide share preview

━━━ stderr · empty
